{
  "text": " Are you going to be able to have a doctor and you and your doctor can decide what's best for you or are you going to get the same treatment as everybody else which the government decided you need to have? They've lied to us. It's manipulation of data. They've outright lied to us and it is a tragedy. We don't have any long-term safety data. The data is being collected now, unfortunately. The university receives very large grants to do clinical trials from the NIH. Many of those are basically funded by pharmaceutical companies. When you go to those committees, it's a pre-determined objective they're going to get approved for toddlers, zero-year-olds, infants, three-year-olds. When I found out that all children's vaccines were free from liability, I was furious. The people that were the most critical of aspects of our vaccine regulatory system are not people that were anti-vax. They're people that grew up deeply believing in the vaccine system. And then something happens and somebody gets injured and then they're like, hold on, how did this system not work? You are getting constant, nudge-style propaganda messaging and the immediate need to vaccinate and then get boosted and so on. And the corporate media was being funded by Pfizer and Moderna. I mean, we know that. They don't call it orders anymore. They call it guidance. It's the WHO guidance that nobody ever voted for. But we are the ones who are somehow anti-democracy. And I know now that this industry has been diabolical against black Americans and all Americans and the commoditization of the black body has been systematically dismantling these communities for decades. There is obviously a stigma associated with anyone who questions the experts. So we've been called anti-vax, anti-science and that. And it's really been an effective way to dismiss any concerns. Army value number seven is personal concern. So this general is in my face. And he said, you will cease and desist giving those informed consents. I said, sir, sir, that's an unlawful order and I will not follow that order. FDA approvals don't matter. Evidence doesn't matter. Injuries don't matter. The plan is everyone must accept a shot every six months. There's a pretty easy decision process for figuring out whether you should mandate something like a vaccine. If the vaccines work, you don't need mandates. And if the vaccines don't work, you don't need mandates either. Maybe just life got so good for everybody. You can go down the street and get Starbucks. It's like, who cares if they take away my first amendment right and ban me on Twitter for sharing a peer reviewed study. I survived the original, we call it the OG COVID, without a vaccine. And I know I will be able to survive the rest. But I thought the vaccine would give me extra protection. And that seems not to be true. Despite having spent umpteen billion dollars, we put all our money on these vaccines that don't work that well in time. And you're not allowed to talk about that. It's a problem. I was also seeing a lot of patients who were emotionally distraught over having to choose between their job and their fear of injecting something with very little research into their bodies. They don't know why he died. No, we know why he died. No, I believe. There's no other logical explanation. The only thing that changed in his life was the vaccine. He was perfectly healthy. It's tough to see all your friends and all the people who previously engaged with you, but just cast your way and forget about you. But I know that we will be back one day. You may find some comfort in knowing that you are not alone and we are all fighting this fight, but we will win.",
